\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">活动前言</span></strong></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; align-self: center; flex: 0 0 auto; min-width: 5%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 12px; color: rgb(254, 222, 151); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">Bussiness &nbsp;Report&nbsp;</span></p></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: auto; flex: 100 100 0%; height: auto; align-self: center; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(210, 16, 16); height: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float: left; line-height: 0; width: 0px; vertical-align: top; visibility: visible;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 15px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 1.7px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">2025年5月15日-17日，备受瞩目的</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">第12届花椒餐博大会</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">如期盛大举行，本次活动以&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(210, 16, 16); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">“品牌立心，产品立命”&nbsp;</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">为主题，汇聚20余位行业大咖、非遗传承人及供应链专家，吸引了众多餐饮行业的精英齐聚一堂，共同探讨行业前沿趋势、分享实战经验。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><br style=\"visibility: visible;\"></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">在这场汇聚智慧与创新的盛会中，北京盈科（沈阳）律师事务所股权高级合伙人、花椒学社法务风控专家、博望团队首席法务</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">马俊龙律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">荣获<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold; visibility: visible;\">「股权架构塑造者」</span>称号，北京盈科（沈阳）律师事务所股权高级合伙人、花椒学社劳动用工专家、博望团队合伙人</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">谢长丽律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">荣获<span textstyle=\"\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">「用工安全守护者」</span>称号。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(210, 16, 16);height: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section></section></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;transform: translate3d(10px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(10px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(10px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(10px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block