ht: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;align-self: center;padding: 0px 0px 0px 7px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: flex;width: 100%;flex-flow: column;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"z-index: 1;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 0%;line-height: 0;height: auto;padding: 0px 3px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 0px;height: 0px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px 0px 3px 6px;border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgb(115, 215, 200);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 0%;line-height: 0;height: auto;padding: 0px 3px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 0px;height: 0px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px 0px 3px 6px;border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgb(255, 216, 90);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 0%;line-height: 0;height: auto;padding: 0px 3px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 0px;height: 0px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px 0px 3px 6px;border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgb(115, 215, 200);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: auto;align-self: center;flex: 100 100 0%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(217, 2, 36);height: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"插图\"></svg></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 15px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;letter-spacing: 1.5px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">马律师与谢律师已经连续多年走上花椒大会的颁奖台，两位律师凭借各自专业的杰出表现，获得了餐饮老板与同仁的高度认可。这更是博望餐饮法务咨询团队在餐饮行业法律服务领域实力的有力证明。博望团队一直专注于为餐饮企业提供全方位法律服务，赢得了众多客户的信赖与好评。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">今年，马俊龙律师荣获</span><span style=\"color: rgb(210, 16, 16);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">「股权架构塑造者」</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">称号，这一荣誉充分体现了他在股权设计方面的深厚专业功底与丰富实践经验。马律师深知合理的股权架构对于餐饮企业的重要性，能够为企业长期稳定发展奠定坚实基础。他的专业服务为众多餐饮企业解决了股权顶层架构搭建、连锁加盟、投融资并购等问题，助力企业在激烈的市场竞争中稳步前行。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">谢长丽律师荣获</span><span style=\"color: rgb(210, 16, 16);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">「用工安全守护者」</span></strong></span><span leaf=\"\">称号，这一荣誉彰显了她在劳动用工领域的专业能力和对餐饮企业用工安全的守护精神。餐饮行业的用工情况复杂多样，面临着诸多劳动纠纷风险。谢律师凭借多年的法律经验为众多餐饮企业提供全面的用工合规建议，确保企业在合法合规的前提下高效运营。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 10px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: middle;width: 50%;align-self: center;flex: 0 0 auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 98%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72L3cWQYKql2ArKuickWKoPcfIhChBicCUicyh2I43cvdooVlebSV5GkfVEMkeGHR32RttQHaD33qib7pg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=4\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"1.5\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(0.666667) / 1; width: 284px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-al