ction></section></section><section style=\"margin: 15px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;line-height: 2;letter-spacing: 1.7px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在烧烤烤肉大会的</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">【烤肉品牌如何实现“产品 + 场景 + 定位”的差异化？】</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">圆桌交流环节中，马俊龙律师作为主持人，与北丐先生、偏脸子烧烤、云龙鲜串、姜老大羊肉串的各位创始人展开了一场精彩纷呈的交流与探讨。马律师凭借其在餐饮行业多年的服务经验以及对市场趋势的敏锐洞察，引导各位嘉宾从自身品牌实际出发，分享在产品创新、口味研发、场景氛围营造、服务体验设计、定位精准度把握、差异化传播等多维度深入剖析品牌的发展现状况与未来机遇。旨在探讨如何通过创新产品研发与呈现、打造沉浸式特色消费场景、精准独特的品牌定位，为烧烤品牌找到破局之道。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: 50%;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 4px;border-color: rgb(255, 229, 190);width: 95%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72L3cWQYKql2ArKuickWKoPcfgcxT9kytHuG2yicGVIYKfsBicKnwHOCfGqeS9ic079v7JuwImiaZVt5gZQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=8\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.5) / 1; width: 267px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"11\" src=\"data: